DeiT-Tiny model files in this directory

Original model: DeiT (Touvron et al., Facebook AI Research), https://github.com/facebookresearch/deit
Checkpoint:     timm/deit_tiny_patch16_224.fb_in1k (Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt)
LiteRT export:  https://huggingface.co/litert-community/deit_tiny_patch16_224 (pinned revision d0677ea57e9dfe6ed8d083d871562435ae90420a)

These files are redistributed WITH MODIFICATIONS for a course project:
  - model.tflite              FP32 LiteRT export, as downloaded from the repository above
  - deit_tiny_fp32.tflite     FP32 LiteRT export regenerated by tools/model/export_deit_w8a8.py
  - deit_tiny_w8a8_pilot.tflite   quantized to W8A8 (INT8 weights and activations) with AI Edge Quantizer;
                                  calibrated on a single image, not accuracy-qualified
  - source_model.safetensors  source checkpoint used for the export

Citations:
  Touvron et al., "Training data-efficient image transformers & distillation through attention", ICML 2021.
  Wightman, "PyTorch Image Models", https://github.com/huggingface/pytorch-image-models

